Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.47,Default,MAID A,0,0,0,,I was informed Lady Kvaravita would \Nlike to speak with Princess Billaura again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:15.41,Default,MAID A,0,0,0,,regarding the matter with Lady Kosmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:19.11,Default,MAID B,0,0,0,,Then what time do you think would be the \Nbest to do a final check of her attire?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.11,0:00:23.60,Default,MAID C,0,0,0,,I shall go see if it's possible to adjust\Nthe time for Professor Marshall's lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.57,0:00:31.71,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:41.05,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I think it's rather too early to be \Nheading to the banquet, but... Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.76,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:46.30,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It pertains to the certain potion \NI handed you the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:49.22,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Thank you for\Nyour assistance with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.87,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Certainly, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.72,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,As I have mentioned before,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:56.41,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I'm providing this document \Nto reiterate the proper dosage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:59.11,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,the administration, and the \Nrisks involving this potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:01.61,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Including improper usage as \Nwell as important precautions—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:04.12,Default_Top,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Too long. I shall read it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.72,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Just leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:13.94,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Despite your appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.94,0:01:17.49,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I knew you were a knight capable of \Nthoughtful and meticulous care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:18.66,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Despite what appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:22.31,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,But lately, you seem \Nmore tense at odd times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.96,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Or rather, you appear restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.19,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,What in the world happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:31.77,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.46,0:01:39.76,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,More importantly, the wedding\Nprocession is finally set for next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:40.97,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:44.24,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Somehow, you seem a bit {\i1}too{\i0}\Ncomposed, Princess Billaura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:46.21,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Do I appear that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:50.29,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Lord Yašm seems to be\Ngrieving far more deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:54.56,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I cannot take my older brother \Nwith me all the way to Nefrit, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:57.50,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,This will be a good chance for \Nhim to let go of his little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:00.96,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I see you've already come\N to terms with it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.96,0:02:05.84,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I should have come to terms \Nwith it at the very moment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:08.68,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I drew my first breath \Nas the king's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.14,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Still, if there's one thing \Nthat concerns me, it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:14.94,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.94,0:02:17.07,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,The love potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:18.10,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.10,0:02:20.25,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,It wasn't even part of\N your official duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:22.02,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,so I'm sure it was troublesome to obtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.04,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,If I may be so bold,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.04,0:02:26.80,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I have always thought of Your\NHighness as a younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.91,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I'd even say I'm grateful to have\N been entrusted with such a duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.91,0:02:30.66,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It was no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.66,0:02:33.61,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Because you spoil me, I have \Nleft all the details to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:36.71,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I know nothing of the one who brewed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:39.68,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I know nothing of their skills, \Nnor their origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.30,0:02:41.81,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:44.67,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That is why I cannot be certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:47.60,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Whether this love potion truly works or—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.60,0:02:48.57,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:49.51,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:51.48,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.19,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Er, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.19,0:02:55.39,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It will definitely work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:02:58.99,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:06.38,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,She must truly be a skillful witch\N to make you utter such words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.38,0:03:08.99,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,One gifted with magic powers, \Npossessing a wealth of knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:11.17,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,and well-versed in terrifying witchcraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.74,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It is true that she is a gifted witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.71,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,However, before that,\Nshe is an ordinary girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:22.86,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Princess Billaura?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.13,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:28.70,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I was surprised to learn for the \Nfirst time that even you judge others
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.36,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,in that way as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.57,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:37.17,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,In the few days that remain, \Nmay you live without regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:52.14,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Without regrets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:09.19,Title,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1000)}Hello, I Am a {\fs35\c&HFABB4F&}W{\c&HD99F7B&}i{\c&HC88498&}t{\c&HB279B9&}c{\c&H8C65FB&}h
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:09.19,Title2,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1000)}and My {\fs26}Crush {\fs20}Wants Me to Make a {\fs26\c&H7E42E6&}Love Potion
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:29.01,Ep Title,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,1000)\pos(136,288)}Episode 7: The One to Cast a\NSpell on the Princess Is a Witch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:28.60,Italics_top,ROSE-INTERNAL,0,0,0,,A strong, cold, northerly \Nwind sweeps autumn away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.85,Italics_top,ROSE-INTERNAL,0,0,0,,and the scent of winter begins \Nto mingle with the morning mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.69,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,The witch's hermitage was in the \Nmidst of preparing for winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:43.22,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I've finished stacking \Nthe firewood already,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:46.63,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,so I need to go exchange the rice husks \Nwith wheat straw to spread onto the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:48.62,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:50.87,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Lord Harij?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:55.84,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,He's spending time here again lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:59.87,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I'm sure he can make it here by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:04.35,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,More importantly, where did\NI put the winter quilt and robe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.07,0:06:13.59,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It's well into the evening already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:18.77,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, what was that \Nbell during the middle of the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.77,0:06:21.14,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,There aren't many beasts out\N this time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:27.87,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:35.40,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Um, are you a dear client?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:38.87,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Did she stay here the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:41.73,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,A witch's secret remedies are expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:46.48,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,so upper class clients usually \Nsend their servants instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.58,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,But there are some eccentric \Nclients who like to come in person,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.38,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,and wait just like this for \Nsomeone to come fetch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:55.25,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Oh, you've finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.55,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,And more often than not, these \Nclients tend to be a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.25,0:07:01.65,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I'm going to get scolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.11,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Are you the witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:10.75,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:13.08,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I am not a client, but I would \Nlike you to invite me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.95,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,It's my fault... Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:25.71,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It's a bit messy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:44.80,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.52,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,O Lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.49,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,She's praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.50,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,It's actually not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:08:00.98,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I am pleased to hear that you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:02.45,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:07.18,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I would like you to call me Lau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.63,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Very well, Lady Lau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:11.86,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Please refer to me as the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.55,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Did she come all this way \Nwearing indoor slippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:20.13,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,From what I see, she's likely \Na daughter of a noble family,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:23.26,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,and I bet the people around her \Nmust be busy looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:26.63,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It must have been cold outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:28.64,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I shall go add more wood to the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:39.19,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You must be surprised \Nby my sudden arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:43.67,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,All my dear clients visit suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:54.97,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:55.80,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You may.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:00.22,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,What pale legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.65,0:09:02.18,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,It looks painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.51,0:09:05.00,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I did leave her out \Nthere for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:16.04,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It must have been difficult coming \Nout all this way on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:19.83,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You're not going to ask me who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:22.51,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,A witch neither pries \Ninto the affairs of anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:25.49,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,who visits this hermitage, nor \Ndoes she speak of them to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.01,0:09:30.29,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Those who rely on a witch's secret \Nremedy tend to harbor a desperate wish
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.25,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,they cannot fulfill on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:37.91,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,All I do is brew the remedy \Nthat is requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:41.22,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Whether they choose to share \Ntheir concerns or aspirations
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:43.42,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,is entirely up to the dear client.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:47.66,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You seem to be a rather convenient \Nentity for the client.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.09,0:09:50.39,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,That is just what a witch is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:54.66,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You would make any remedy\N that is requested of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:59.87,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,If that is what the client \Ntruly desires from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:02.87,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Do you truly believe that \Nhaving a desperate wish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:06.82,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,justifies seeking a remedy \Nthat alters the human heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.74,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Would you hesitate to give a remedy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:17.72,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,to a sick person who \Ndesperately wishes to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.17,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Are you saying you are just as \Nqualified as an apothecary?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.47,0:10:24.21,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,As far as I am concerned, \Nnothing is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:27.39,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It is something that has a special \Neffect on the mind and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:28.89,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,That is what a remedy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.44,0:10:33.95,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,And, anyone who comes to this \Nhermitage, without exception,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:37.81,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,are my cherished clients, including\N wealthy young ladies like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:45.18,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I see, they are {\i1}all{\i0} your \Ncherished clients, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.01,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:48.65,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I, as well as the others, \Nwithout exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:54.22,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I'm getting a feeling that she's laughing \Nat me about something else, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.70,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:06.89,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Witch. I am someone who has \Ndesired your remedy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:11.41,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I am to wed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:14.78,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,And in a far off place. Very, very far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.24,0:11:16.25,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:19.62,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I was born here, and raised on this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.82,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I came to love everything \Nabout this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:25.40,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,It's almost like me with this hermitage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.68,0:11:28.01,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,However, this land...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:30.39,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,This land I had continued \Nto protect for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:33.37,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I may never set foot upon it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.35,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.16,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:45.35,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Eventually, I had always intended to set \Nout somewhere for the sake of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:49.55,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,But it's not uncommon for \None to be overly optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:56.97,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,My fate was just significant enough\N to determine everything about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:01.13,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Perhaps she has lived her entire life
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.13,0:12:04.42,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,without ever stepping foot outside \Nthe bounds of her own position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:08.90,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Much like a witch, there was something \Nthat she was born with, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.97,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Shall I listen for a little while longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:27.44,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Yes, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.38,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I probably just wanted \Nto talk to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.69,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Tell me, witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.22,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Have you ever fallen \Nin love with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.69,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What? Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:38.79,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:42.89,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,As one of your humble clients, might\NI ask you to share your story with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:46.84,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I... My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:49.46,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I see. I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.62,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Why would you be interested in me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:56.66,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I have no one I can speak \Nto about such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.42,0:13:01.98,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Neither my mother, my friends,\Nnor my maids speak their mind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.10,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:05.49,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Except for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:08.80,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,You're the only one who's told me \NI was no different from anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.38,0:13:15.51,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Thus I thought here at this \Nhermitage, I can simply be Lau.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:22.34,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:25.01,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I'll tell you about an acquaintance— No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:28.07,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Or rather, about someone in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.51,0:13:29.86,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I would love to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:37.82,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,There is someone who frequently\N intrudes into this person's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.39,0:13:42.12,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,The intruder's actions are \Nfundamentally incomprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:43.58,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Do they detest them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:48.64,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,No, they just feel like a knife\N is being held to their throat,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:52.88,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,while being forced to play along in some \Nincomprehensible game by the nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:57.24,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Half-happy and half-scared, it \Nseems they have come to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.64,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,If they're to be stabbed, \Nthey hope it will be soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.51,0:14:04.49,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,In other words, they love \Nthem that much then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.49,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I suppose they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:08.19,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:10.41,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:14.00,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Love that has been complicated \Nfor years is stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.52,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Even after countless tearful nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:17.80,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,telling myself I'm going to stop loving him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:22.16,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,every single morning, \NI find that I still do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.68,0:14:27.50,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I find myself... feeling terribly \Nenvious of that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.34,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.65,0:14:31.55,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I have never fallen in love with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:36.31,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Moreover, the man I am to marry is a \Nwidower, who is forty years older than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.26,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,A widower...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.26,0:14:42.02,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I hardly know the person\NI am to marry to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:46.35,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,No, I suppose I do recall him \Nbeing kind to me at the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:48.56,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,But that's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.43,0:14:52.69,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,No. Even though I think \NI've come to terms with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:55.54,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,just imagining my life over \Nthere gives me cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:59.24,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,If I cannot take my own family \Nnor my knights with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:02.05,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I wanted at least one thing \Nto act as my support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.44,0:15:05.26,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Therefore, I coveted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:08.64,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:12.60,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That's right. The love potion you brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:16.67,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,With beauty such as yours Lady Lau,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:19.06,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,a witch's secret remedy \Nwould pale in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:23.01,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,No, it is not to be used \Nto captivate the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.01,0:15:24.06,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.00,0:15:27.70,Default_Top,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,It is for me to use to fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:29.99,Eyecatch_small,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)\3c&HF2F8FA&\3a&H91&\pos(495,206)}Hello, I Am a {\c&HFABB4F&}W{\c&HD99F7B&}i{\c&HC88498&}t{\c&HB279B9&}c{\c&H8C65FB&}h {\c&H2F3094&}and\NMy Crush Wants Me to\NMake a {\c&H7E42E6&}Love Potion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:32.99,Eyecatch_big_bottom,SIGN,0,0,0,,and My {\fs26}Crush{\fs20} Wants Me to Make a {\fs26\c&H7E42E6&}Love Potion
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:32.99,Eyecatch_big_top,SIGN,0,0,0,,Hello, I am a {\fs30\c&HFABB4F&}W{\c&HD99F7B&}i{\c&HC88498&}t{\c&HB279B9&}c{\c&H8C65FB&}h
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.46,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,For you to fall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:41.91,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,No matter what happens or what is done \Nto me, I must always remain smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:45.37,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Loving one's husband would \Nserve as that support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:51.84,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,But I lack the confidence to experience\N the kind of true love you speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:57.84,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I can offer my name and body,\Nbut my heart I cannot freely offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:01.36,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That is why I relied on you, dear witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:08.83,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,You word it as if a witch's secret remedy,\N which people despise, gives you hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:12.60,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,That's right. You will \Nbe the one to assist me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.07,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,It is an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:19.29,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Ah, I feel so refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:23.18,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,This is my first time openly \Ntalking to someone like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.18,0:16:27.03,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,As well as walking along a path I like,\Nand even being alone in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:29.49,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Didn't you feel lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:32.63,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,No, it was all simply new to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:36.97,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,And while I was enraptured, before \NI knew it, the sun had already set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:39.94,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Were you able to have a wonderful day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:42.93,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Very. Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.93,0:16:46.89,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Your story left a deep \Nimpression on me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:48.85,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I am humbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:52.04,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I'll go make us some warm tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.04,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:04.46,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Lady Lau. It seems an acquaintance \Nof mine has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:05.78,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Your acquaintance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:09.25,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I will go turn him away, \Nso please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:16.42,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.99,0:17:20.83,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:22.60,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,There was no boat, so \NI didn't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:24.15,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.07,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,I am afraid that today—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.48,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Sorry, but it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:30.45,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Are there remedies or fortune-telling \Nmethods for finding lost items?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.03,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I can immediately provide any\N needed tools or ingredients—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:33.94,Default_Top,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.82,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Princess Billaura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:41.55,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What? That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.00,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,That's Her Highness the Princess?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:47.15,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Um, regarding your lost item...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.42,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:50.85,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,It is now no longer needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:52.79,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:58.75,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Why have you slipped away all by \Nyourself without a word to anyone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.75,0:18:00.62,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Why are you in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:03.23,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,How did you manage to get \Nhere all by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:07.67,Default_Top,HARIJ,0,0,0,,The path would surely have been \Nimpossible to walk with those slippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.67,0:18:11.52,Default_Top,HARIJ {FADE TO BACKGROUND},0,0,0,,As a result, some have begun to claim \Nthat you're hiding within the royal palace
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.02,Default_Top,HARIJ {FADE TO BACKGROUND},0,0,0,,and started searching the storehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:17.18,Default_Top,HARIJ {FADE TO BACKGROUND},0,0,0,,Even now, Geones is running\Naround town searching for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.18,0:18:20.43,Default_Top,HARIJ {FADE TO BACKGROUND},0,0,0,,Lady Lulu seemed deeply anxious \Nwhile worrying over Lord Yašm,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.37,Default_Top,HARIJ {FADE TO BACKGROUND},0,0,0,,who'd foamed at the mouth and collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:13.44,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I suspected she was a noble,\Nbut it turns out, she's Princess Billaura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:17.08,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Which means she'd wanted the love potion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:21.43,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,and her Royal Knight Guard, Lord Harij, \Ncame to purchase it on her behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.58,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Do you understand how much\N chaos you've caused at the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:28.29,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Just how many people do you \Nsuppose went looking for—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:32.25,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Yes, I apologize. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:38.22,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I wanted to spend this day in such a way \Nso that I would leave with no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.67,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Princess Billaura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.24,0:18:43.14,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I've overstepped by interjecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:49.11,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, including my \Nfailure to be by your side to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.58,0:18:51.71,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.77,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I've caused you much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:19:00.13,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I humbly implore you to keep \Nthose admirable words in mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.98,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,until you return to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.91,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,There is no need to fear.\NI will return home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.36,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Princess Billaura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:10.84,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Princess Billaura, please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:12.76,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Dear witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:16.27,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I regret that my stay here turned \Nout to be such a ruckus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:19.75,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Next time, please do stay for some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.46,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Indeed, I shall take my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.43,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we head home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:27.86,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Oh, please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.85,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Um, let's see... I think it \Nwas around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:36.53,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,The forest at night is dark and \Ndangerous, so please, take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.09,0:19:39.40,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,You owned those sorts of boots as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.85,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:44.58,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I guess Tien's souvenirs do \Ncome in handy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:46.78,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,I will gratefully accept your kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:53.71,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Dear witch, see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.75,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Hm, these are indeed easy to walk in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.04,0:20:03.23,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,There are many things in the \Nworld I have yet to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:07.93,Default,BILLAURA,0,0,0,,Light and warm, with these I can \Nclear the forest in a single bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:11.73,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,My apologies for causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:14.83,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Don't suddenly close in on me! \NIt's bad for my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:18.30,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Apologies to you for having to\N give up those boots as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:20.16,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I will certainly make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:22.86,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,His hair is still disheveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:28.18,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,He's always so infuriatingly \Ncondescending, and yet today alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:31.17,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,how many times have I heard \Nhim offer apologies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:38.20,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,All of this is because Lord Harij \Ncomes by almost every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.53,0:20:41.39,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Even though he's someone \NI could never be with,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:45.03,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,he makes me mistakenly believe \NI know everything about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:48.91,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Shall I make haste with \Nyour second request?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.91,0:20:49.85,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.09,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,The first one was for Princess Lau.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.09,0:20:55.05,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,The second is for your \Nown self, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.63,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:01.77,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Prying into a client's personal affairs\N goes against the witch's creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:04.98,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be necessary \Nbefore Princess Lau weds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:06.21,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.51,0:21:11.03,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,The ugly words that come from my \Njealousy are unbearably shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:14.15,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,And yet, despite knowing my words \Nare foolish, I cannot stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.50,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,What I mean is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.50,0:21:19.48,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,because you don't want Princess Lau to \Nforget you, you requested the potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:20.60,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.60,0:21:23.33,Default,ROSE,0,0,0,,Then you can't possibly be trying \Nto forcefully elope with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:25.14,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,I said you're mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:38.35,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,Quite unusual of you to be \Nconcerned about a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.69,0:21:40.31,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,I've disappointed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.12,0:21:45.27,Italics,ROSE-Internal,0,0,0,,Even though I'm a witch, why did I have\N to say something so unnecessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:54.24,Default,HARIJ,0,0,0,,In any case, I shall come again soon.
